### filter by orgId.
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30&organizationId=1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis usage in the organization level
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/usage?startDate=2023-12-17&endDate=2024-01-17
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis usage in the list level.
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis usage in the list level.
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis usage in the organization level
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/usage?startDate=2023-07-01&endDate=2023-07-30
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis limit for all organizations
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/limit
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis limit for a specific organization
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/limit?organizationId=1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis limit for a specific organization type
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/limit?organizationType=2
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis limit for a specific organization type
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/options
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis limit for current account organizations
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/usagePercentage
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return analysis usage for current account organizations users
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/usage/users
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### download analysis usage by users csv export for current organizations
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/usage/users/download
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### return extended limits for current account organization
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/extendedLimits
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### returns rollover limits for current account organization
GET https://localhost:8443/analytics/myorg/rolloverLimits
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

